			"notes": "## Highlights\n\n- **MaceAura — Instant one-shot smash**: spoofs server-side fall distance so the mace smash bonus applies while standing still or flying (no real fall needed). Tunable via `SpoofFall`, with `FullCharge` for max-damage swings.\n- **MaceAura reliability**: attacks through the vanilla attack path so the mace is synced to the server before the hit; finds/switches to a mace across the hotbar with proper carried-item sync.\n- **Targets modes**: both MaceAura and KillAura now support `Players` / `Mobs` / `All`.\n\n## Install\n1. Java 21 + Fabric Loader for Minecraft 1.21 + Fabric API + Fabric Language Kotlin\n2. Drop `aquaticaces-1.4.3.jar` into your `mods` folder\n\n## Notes\n- Keep `NoFall` off while using MaceAura `Instant` (it rewrites movement packets and cancels the spoof).\n- The instant smash is a packet exploit; strict anticheats may flag it."
		},
