			"notes": "## Summary\n- **Loading screen** — Full Aquatic Aces branded splash replaces vanilla Mojang screen; fixed broken text rendering\n- **Multiplayer** — Server cards show favicon, name, IP, MOTD, online/offline status, ping, and player count\n- **ClickGUI** — Right-click opens a scrollable settings side panel instead of a cramped bottom strip\n- **XRay** — Rewritten with configurable block toggles and proper render mixins\n- **Module fixes** — AutoReconnect, NoFall, Criticals, Hitboxes, Chams, Nametags, NoSlowdown, FastPlace, LogoutSpot, PerformanceHUD, and more\n- **MaceAura** — New combat module for mace PvP\n\n## Install\n1. Install Java 21, Fabric 1.21, Fabric API, and Fabric Language Kotlin\n2. Download `aquaticaces-1.4.0.jar` and place it in `.minecraft/mods`\n3. Launch Minecraft — ClickGUI default keybind is **Right Shift**\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] Loading screen shows Aquatic Aces branding with readable text\n- [ ] Multiplayer list displays server status, ping, and favicons after refresh\n- [ ] ClickGUI right-click opens side settings panel with scroll support\n- [ ] XRay toggles blocks correctly in-game\n- [ ] MaceAura targets and attacks with mace"
