			"notes": "## Aquatic Aces v1.3.8\n\nQuality-of-life and branding fixes.\n\n### Fixes\n- **ClickGUI keybind**: the menu now opens reliably on its keybind (default **Right Shift**) and falls back to Right Shift if the bind was lost. Loading an old config no longer clears default keybinds.\n- **Branded logo**: the ClickGUI now shows the real Aquatic Aces logo instead of a placeholder \"A\". The logo art is processed at runtime so its white background is removed and the silhouette reads cleanly on the dark UI.\n- **Custom loading screen**: the vanilla Mojang loading screen is replaced with a branded Aquatic Aces splash — logo, title, and a live progress bar — without affecting startup or the transition to the main menu.\n\n### Install\nDownload `aquaticaces-1.3.8.jar` and drop it into `.minecraft/mods` alongside **Fabric API** and **Fabric Language Kotlin** (Minecraft 1.21, Java 21)."
